{"id":"n66623-1-7","stage":4,"title":"썰매 · 雪橇","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66623-1-7-1","ko":"날이 얼마나 추운지 강물이 꽁꽁 얼었더라.","zh":"天气冷极了，河水都冻得结结实实的呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"날이","meaning":"天气","explanation":"날：天气；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"날","audio":"/audio/818c8a303c20bac05fae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62254","senseId":"3","lemma":"날","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"날이","audio":"/audio/fecb7256d8859fcee381.mp3"}},{"text":"얼마나","meaning":"多么","explanation":"얼마나：多么。","readings":[{"term":"얼마나","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67316","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼마나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼마나","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3"}},{"text":"추운지","meaning":"冷","explanation":"춥다：冷；은지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"춥다","audio":"/audio/7c651efb56d12a6540a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72146","senseId":"2","lemma":"춥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"추운지","audio":"/audio/0efb9a93126b9b94bf23.mp3"}},{"text":"강물이","meaning":"江水，河水","explanation":"강물：江水，河水；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"강물","audio":"/audio/3d813865c018ad5e2e1e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62662","senseId":"1","lemma":"강물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"강물이","audio":"/audio/b70b07a5aa0a4adadfa9.mp3"}},{"text":"꽁꽁","meaning":"坚硬地，硬实地，硬邦邦地","explanation":"꽁꽁：坚硬地，硬实地，硬邦邦地。","readings":[{"term":"꽁꽁","audio":"/audio/5e59b23064fb27d12e74.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38208","senseId":"1","lemma":"꽁꽁","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꽁꽁","audio":"/audio/5e59b23064fb27d12e74.mp3"}},{"text":"얼었더라.","meaning":"冻结，冻","explanation":"얼다：冻结，冻；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；더라：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"얼다","audio":"/audio/483a31bad3d8768e32a5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66572","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼었더라","audio":"/audio/868d78523a89f8dc4318.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"818c8a303c20bac0","term":"날","zh":"天气","audio":"/audio/818c8a303c20bac05fae.mp3","entryId":"62254","definition":"每一天的雨、云、风、气温等的状态。","pronunciation":["날"]},{"id":"7ab030dec3a95b0f","term":"얼마나","zh":"多么","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3","entryId":"67316","definition":"状态或感觉等的程度非常大而厉害地。","pronunciation":["얼마나"]},{"id":"7c651efb56d12a65","term":"춥다","zh":"冷","audio":"/audio/7c651efb56d12a6540a4.mp3","entryId":"72146","definition":"大气温度低。","pronunciation":["춥따"]},{"id":"3d813865c018ad5e","term":"강물","zh":"江水，河水","audio":"/audio/3d813865c018ad5e2e1e.mp3","entryId":"62662","definition":"在江河里流淌的水。","pronunciation":["강물"]},{"id":"5e59b23064fb27d1","term":"꽁꽁","zh":"坚硬地，硬实地，硬邦邦地","audio":"/audio/5e59b23064fb27d12e74.mp3","entryId":"38208","definition":"水、地面、事物等被冻得很结实的样子。","pronunciation":["꽁꽁"]},{"id":"483a31bad3d8768e","term":"얼다","zh":"冻结，冻","audio":"/audio/483a31bad3d8768e32a5.mp3","entryId":"66572","definition":"液体或有水气的物体因冷而结成固体状态。","pronunciation":["얼ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ee6ceedb4c19402f5a33.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66623-1-7-2","ko":"그럼 우리 썰매 타러 가자!","zh":"那我们一起去滑雪橇吧！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样。","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"썰매","meaning":"雪橇","explanation":"썰매：雪橇。","readings":[{"term":"썰매","audio":"/audio/c63b2d3dd5aab064e869.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66623","senseId":"1","lemma":"썰매","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"썰매","audio":"/audio/c63b2d3dd5aab064e869.mp3"}},{"text":"타러","meaning":"滑雪橇、坐雪橇","explanation":"타다：借助雪橇滑行；러：用于移动动词前，表示移动的目的：“去/来做……”。","readings":[{"term":"타다","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17160","senseId":"7","lemma":"타다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"타러","audio":"/audio/dc1f88b05849fdbc6221.mp3"}},{"text":"가자!","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가자","audio":"/audio/9d6a16e0f490c47dce42.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"c63b2d3dd5aab064","term":"썰매","zh":"雪橇","audio":"/audio/c63b2d3dd5aab064e869.mp3","entryId":"66623","definition":"在雪或冰面上可以滑行的用木头或塑料等制成的器具。","pronunciation":["썰매"]},{"id":"8f835109fdc29a59","term":"타다","zh":"借助雪橇滑行","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3","entryId":"17160","definition":"借助雪橇滑行","pronunciation":["타다"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8f7bc5b665708c7164d3.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.036,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=66623","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":144,"sequenc